  <scopecontent id="8ed5f6a3525dc8ee718367516435173e">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>Contains portraits of Rockefeller family members, photographs of cemeteries, headstones, and homes, correspondence and scrapbooks related to genealogy, and deeds and wills of Rockefellers.</p>  </scopecontent>
